<title>UK: Tambang Timah at $17.15 in London.</title>
<headline>Tambang Timah at $17.15 in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah closed at $17.15 per GDR in London on Monday. It recorded the day's low of $17.125 and the day's high of $17.25.</p>
<p>It closed at $17.1500 on Friday.</p>
<p>One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
